    <data key="d0">Funbox Serverless Data Job Orchestration Platform Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qz8uXtDC1bY</data>
    <data key="d2">Orchestrates data pipeline jobs (SQL, Python, Spark) using AWS serverless technologies like Step Functions, Fargate, Lambda, and API Gateway.</data>
